  "description": "Typed, versioned, provider-neutral Alerts contract surface (W043, in-package full surface): severity + escalation policy as sealed versioned data (finding class token + status -> severity -> escalation path), alert records as append-only revision chains with idempotent deduplication, escalation outcomes bound to verifiable W003 gateway decisions, and typed notifications over the closed neutral channel vocabulary. JSON Schema projection under schemas/; runtime validators in @epoch/alerts.",
